# ==============================================================================
# KLARONE ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION GUIDE
# ==============================================================================
# This directory contains template references for each tier:
#   1. .env.local.example    -> Used for local laptop development (dev branch / localhost)
#   2. .env.staging.example  -> Used for Staging (Render & Vercel staging tier)
#   3. .env.production.example -> Used for Production (Render & Vercel main tier)
#
# Rule: Never commit real .env secrets to Git. Configure these variables inside
# Render / Vercel dashboard settings for Staging and Production.
# ==============================================================================
